#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Secrets de signature Android — jamais sur GitHub
/android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# Cache Gradle local (distributions téléchargées, ~400 Mo+) — jamais versionné
/android/.gradle/
/android/gradle/wrapper/dists/
.gradle/

# Config locale de l'outil Claude Code — jamais versionnee (peut contenir des secrets de session)
.claude/
